    "# LongAudioBench: Kaggle Evaluation Pipeline\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook runs the complete LongAudioBench evaluation on Kaggle GPUs.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Tasks:** ANiH, Speaker Drift, Soundscape, Narrative Coherence\n",
    "**Models:** Whisper-large-v3 + Llama-3-8B (cascaded), SALMONN-7B, Qwen2-Audio-7B-Instruct\n",
    "**Datasets:** LibriSpeech, VoxCeleb2, AudioSet, Freesound, AMI (via Hugging Face)\n",
    "\n",
    "## Setup\n",
    "1. Enable GPU accelerator (T4 × 2 or P100)\n",
    "2. Add internet access\n",
    "3. Add your Hugging Face token as a secret (named `HF_TOKEN`) for gated models\n",
    "4. Run all cells sequentially"
   ]
